<%- include('../../partials/dashboard-header', { title, active: 'manage' }) %>
<a class="back-link" href="/admin/tournaments/<%= tournament.id %>/competition">← Competition workspace</a>
<section class="operator-hero">
  <div><span class="eyebrow">Physical tournament operator</span><h1><%= tournament.name %></h1><p>Run the draw, publish venue timings, operate coverage, and keep every player informed from the first match to the final.</p></div>
  <div class="operator-hero-actions"><a class="button button-secondary" href="/tournaments/<%= tournament.id %>/bracket">Public draw</a><a class="button" href="/tournaments/<%= tournament.id %>/timetable">Public timetable</a></div>
</section>
<% if (error) { %><p class="alert alert-error"><%= error %></p><% } %>
<section class="operator-stat-grid"><article><span>Confirmed field</span><strong><%= tournament.registrations.length %></strong><small>Eligible players</small></article><article><span>Fixture draw</span><strong><%= tournament.matches.length ? 'Ready' : 'Draft' %></strong><small><%= tournament.matches.length ? `${tournament.matches.length} fixtures created` : 'Awaiting generation' %></small></article><article><span>Timetable</span><strong><%= tournament.timetable?.publishedAt ? 'Live' : 'Private' %></strong><small>Public schedule status</small></article><article><span>Coverage</span><strong><%= tournament.stream?.status || 'Offline' %></strong><small>Broadcast status</small></article></section>
<section class="operator-grid">
  <article class="operator-panel"><span class="operator-icon">⌁</span><h2>1. Generate the official draw</h2><p>Create every round from the opening matches through the final. A verified winner is assigned to the correct next fixture automatically.</p><form method="post" action="/admin/tournaments/<%= tournament.id %>/draw"><button class="button" type="submit" <%= tournament.matches.length ? 'disabled' : '' %>><%= tournament.matches.length ? 'Draw generated' : 'Generate knockout draw' %></button></form></article>
  <article class="operator-panel"><span class="operator-icon">♜</span><h2>2. Publish professional rules</h2><form class="form-grid" method="post" action="/admin/tournaments/<%= tournament.id %>/rulebook"><label>Rulebook title<input name="title" value="<%= tournament.rulebook?.title || `${tournament.game.name} tournament rules` %>" required></label><label>Rules and officiating guidance<textarea name="content" required><%= tournament.rulebook?.content || '' %></textarea></label><label class="check-label"><input type="checkbox" name="publish" value="true" <%= tournament.rulebook?.publishedAt ? 'checked' : '' %>> Publish rules to players and visitors</label><button class="button" type="submit">Save rulebook</button></form></article>
  <article class="operator-panel"><span class="operator-icon">◷</span><h2>3. Publish the timetable</h2><p>Publishing notifies every confirmed player and makes the ordered fixtures visible publicly.</p><form class="form-grid" method="post" action="/admin/tournaments/<%= tournament.id %>/timetable/publish"><label>Venue and schedule note<textarea name="notes" placeholder="Venue, check-in time, court or table allocation, and arrival guidance"><%= tournament.timetable?.notes || '' %></textarea></label><button class="button" type="submit">Publish timetable</button></form></article>
  <article class="operator-panel"><span class="operator-icon">▶</span><h2>4. Operate live coverage</h2><p>Configure a secure public playback URL and, optionally, a WHIP camera ingest endpoint. Visitors and officials remain blocked until you explicitly enable the live broadcast.</p><form class="form-grid" method="post" action="/admin/tournaments/<%= tournament.id %>/stream"><label>Coverage title<input name="title" value="<%= tournament.stream?.title || `${tournament.name} live coverage` %>" required></label><label>Provider<input name="provider" value="<%= tournament.stream?.provider || 'Camera / broadcast provider' %>" required></label><label>Public playback URL<input type="url" name="sourceUrl" value="<%= tournament.stream?.sourceUrl || '' %>" required></label><label>WHIP camera ingest URL (optional)<input type="url" name="ingestUrl" value="<%= tournament.stream?.ingestUrl || '' %>"><small class="upload-hint">Required for officials to transmit their venue camera through a WHIP-compatible provider.</small></label><label>Stream status<select name="status"><% ['OFFLINE', 'LIVE', 'ENDED'].forEach((status) => { %><option value="<%= status %>" <%= tournament.stream?.status === status ? 'selected' : '' %>><%= status %></option><% }) %></select></label><label class="check-label"><input type="checkbox" name="isEnabled" value="true" <%= tournament.stream?.isEnabled ? 'checked' : '' %>> Enable public viewing and official camera controls</label><button class="button" type="submit"><%= tournament.stream?.isEnabled ? 'Update public live stream' : 'Activate public live stream' %></button></form></article>
</section>
<%- include('../../partials/dashboard-footer') %>
